    "q-533": {
      "dom_id": "step-q533",
      "name": "Question 2",
      "problem": "What is the value of ${\\text{i}}^{2}?$",
      "worked_solution": "Let's recall the first few powers of $\\text{i},$ where $\\text{i}=\\sqrt{-1}:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\text{i}}^{0} & =1 \\\\ {\\text{i}}^{1} & =\\text{i} \\\\ {\\text{i}}^{2} & =-1 \\\\ {\\text{i}}^{3} & ={\\text{i}}^{2}\\cdot \\text{i}=(-1)\\cdot \\text{i}=-\\text{i} \\\\ {\\text{i}}^{4} & ={\\text{i}}^{2}\\cdot {\\text{i}}^{2}=(-1)\\cdot (-1)=1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we have that ${\\text{i}}^{2}=-1.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
