    "q-921": {
      "dom_id": "step-q921",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "What is the value of ${\\text{i}}^{7}?$",
      "worked_solution": "To find the value of $\\text{i}$ raised to some positive integer power $n$, we divide $n$ by $4,$ and raise $\\text{i}$ to the remainder.\n\nIn our case, we have $n=7.$ Dividing the power by $4,$ we get\n\n$$\n7÷4=1\\,\\text{R}3.\n$$\n\nSo the remainder is $3.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\n{\\text{i}}^{7}={\\text{i}}^{3}=-\\text{i}.\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
